0.19.199.702 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
0.19.199.703 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "The Virginia attorney general asked the law firm of O'Melveny & Myers to take a look at how the university historically handled allegations of sexual assault by its students. ", "add_special": true}
0.19.199.703 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[760,12617,13352,4437,4439,279,2253,7239,314,496,26708,300,1002,88,594,48536,310,1831,264,1353,506,1204,279,11759,33649,17083,17821,314,7017,11366,539,1141,4007,13,220]}
