0.19.200.208 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
0.19.200.209 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "That includes how UVA officials handled the allegations in the discredited Rolling Stone article by a student the magazine called \"Jackie,\" especially since the school knew about the allegations for more than a year before the article came out. ", "add_special": true}
0.19.200.209 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[4639,5469,1204,533,12452,7128,17083,279,17821,303,279,801,63973,43451,13892,4400,539,264,5286,279,14005,2512,328,31551,627,1288,5142,2394,279,2812,6661,883,279,17821,364,777,1056,264,1007,1518,279,4400,3571,680,13,220]}
