0.19.200.599 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
0.19.200.600 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "The alleged gang rape at a fraternity house was in 2012, and Jackie told the university about it the next spring. ", "add_special": true}
0.19.200.600 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[760,10178,12797,16289,506,264,75611,3626,557,303,220,17,15,16,17,11,321,49154,3125,279,11759,883,424,279,1727,10151,13,220]}
