0.19.201.131 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
0.19.201.131 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "She started telling her story very publicly, including at a \"take back the night\" rally. ", "add_special": true}
0.19.201.132 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[7691,3727,11294,1024,3255,1546,16909,11,2583,506,264,328,22060,1142,279,3603,1,18637,13,220]}
0.19.201.589 D srv          stop: all tasks already finished, no need to cancel
0.19.201.595 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
0.19.201.596 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "But Charlottesville police didn't hear about it until after a separate incident in the spring of 2014, in which Jackie claimed someone threw a bottle that hit her in the face. ", "add_special": true}
0.19.201.596 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[3850,61489,4142,3105,914,6512,883,424,2980,1238,264,8387,10142,303,279,10151,314,220,17,15,16,19,11,303,864,49154,11324,4184,21504,264,16002,421,4062,1024,303,279,3460,13,220]}
