0.19.202.119 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
0.19.202.122 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "When a university dean arranged for her to talk to police about that alleged assault, she also told the story of the alleged 2012 incident. ", "add_special": true}
0.19.202.122 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[4350,264,11759,70387,26899,364,1024,310,2963,310,4142,883,421,10178,11366,11,1292,1048,3125,279,3255,314,279,10178,220,17,15,16,17,10142,13,220]}
