0.19.202.497 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
0.19.202.498 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "In both cases, police said Jackie refused to cooperate and so they could not pursue the case. ", "add_special": true}
0.19.202.499 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[623,2107,4886,11,4142,1018,49154,15578,310,45238,321,748,781,1362,524,22022,279,1105,13,220]}
0.19.202.991 D srv          stop: all tasks already finished, no need to cancel
0.19.202.998 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
0.19.202.998 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "But more women came forward to talk about their experiences -- women whose stories were not as dramatic or horrific as Jackie's. ", "add_special": true}
0.19.202.999 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[3850,777,3096,3571,4487,310,2963,883,836,11120,1137,3096,6483,7112,998,524,430,21100,466,44680,430,49154,579,13,220]}
0.19.203.540 D srv          stop: all tasks already finished, no need to cancel
0.19.203.547 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
0.19.203.548 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "Rolling Stone's story opened up a conversation about the topic, and then women began coming forward to talk about a culture on campus that was not sensitive to victims. ", "add_special": true}
0.19.203.548 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[31287,286,13892,579,3255,8660,685,264,10125,883,279,8282,11,321,1179,3096,5820,4840,4487,310,2963,883,264,7431,383,14873,421,557,524,15739,310,12059,13,220]}
