0.19.203.998 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
0.19.204.000 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "Many women told CNN about a euphemism for the word rape used by other students on campus. ", "add_special": true}
0.19.204.000 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[8181,3096,3125,19166,883,264,61786,28085,2074,364,279,3299,16289,1429,539,975,4007,383,14873,13,220]}
