0.19.208.137 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
0.19.208.138 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "When the story was deleted from Rolling Stone's website, that was lost. ", "add_special": true}
0.19.208.138 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[4350,279,3255,557,10739,494,43451,13892,579,3779,11,421,557,5384,13,220]}
