0.19.208.692 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
0.19.208.693 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "\"You lose a lot of other people's voices who were in that article,\" said Sarah Roderick, a survivor and UVA student, \"and a lot of good things that could have come about. ", "add_special": true}
0.19.208.693 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[20946,8779,264,2609,314,975,1208,579,22589,852,998,303,421,4400,1288,1018,19822,423,4175,839,11,264,47026,321,533,12452,5286,11,328,429,264,2609,314,1603,2433,421,1362,599,2445,883,13,220]}
