0.20.420.495 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
0.20.420.495 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "Incredibly, as they got closer, they saw there was a man on it, signaling for help. ", "add_special": true}
0.20.420.495 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[623,10527,6284,11,430,781,2597,11784,11,781,5312,1017,557,264,855,383,424,11,40593,364,1438,13,220]}
