0.20.421.140 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
0.20.421.140 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "\"He was moving, walking around, waving to us and in surprisingly good condition,\" Capt. ", "add_special": true}
0.20.421.141 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[25485,557,6992,11,11107,2094,11,60980,310,586,321,303,27373,1603,2876,1288,16115,13,220]}
