0.20.426.366 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
0.20.426.366 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "\"He looked good. ", "add_special": true}
0.20.426.368 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[25485,6749,1603,13,220]}
0.20.426.675 D srv          stop: all tasks already finished, no need to cancel
0.20.426.685 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
0.20.426.686 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "Hadn't lost too much weight. ", "add_special": true}
0.20.426.688 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[53606,77,914,5384,2166,1691,4528,13,220]}
0.20.427.167 D srv          stop: all tasks already finished, no need to cancel
0.20.427.171 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
0.20.427.171 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "He wasn't badly sunburned like I thought he probably would be,\" he said. ", "add_special": true}
0.20.427.172 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[1465,5532,914,23793,6797,21048,290,1040,353,3272,551,4507,1000,381,1288,551,1018,13,220]}
