0.20.427.524 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
0.20.427.524 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "Lost at sea for 66 days. ", "add_special": true}
0.20.427.525 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[45677,506,9117,364,220,21,21,2756,13,220]}
0.20.427.836 D srv          stop: all tasks already finished, no need to cancel
0.20.427.840 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
0.20.427.845 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "After his food and water ran out, it became an issue of survival. ", "add_special": true}
0.20.427.846 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[5836,780,3487,321,2919,10298,680,11,424,5924,449,4125,314,19060,13,220]}
