0.20.428.201 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
0.20.428.203 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "Collecting fresh water was a nightmare for Jordan.  ", "add_special": true}
0.20.428.204 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[45920,286,7478,2919,557,264,36561,364,16586,13,256]}
0.20.428.522 D srv          stop: all tasks already finished, no need to cancel
0.20.428.532 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
0.20.428.534 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "The weather wouldn't cooperate. ", "add_special": true}
