0.20.430.561 D srv          stop: all tasks already finished, no need to cancel
0.20.430.565 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
0.20.430.565 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "I filled up a bucket.\" Then there was the issue of food. ", "add_special": true}
0.20.430.565 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[40,9896,685,264,15162,1149,4844,1017,557,279,4125,314,3487,13,220]}
0.20.430.818 D srv          stop: all tasks already finished, no need to cancel
0.20.430.821 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
0.20.430.821 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "The fish weren't cooperating, but after a while Jordan learned they were attracted to his laundry, which he would put out to sea for a rinse. ", "add_special": true}
0.20.430.822 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[760,7397,14290,914,78679,11,694,1238,264,1345,16586,9218,781,998,27117,310,780,32960,11,864,551,1000,2113,680,310,9117,364,264,70751,13,220]}
0.20.431.183 D srv          stop: all tasks already finished, no need to cancel
0.20.431.192 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
0.20.431.194 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "The fish would swim in and out of his clothes and he could easily scoop them up with a hand net, he said. ", "add_special": true}
0.20.431.194 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[760,7397,1000,15714,303,321,680,314,780,14656,321,551,1362,6497,54513,1070,685,440,264,1375,4041,11,551,1018,13,220]}
0.20.431.402 D srv          stop: all tasks already finished, no need to cancel
0.20.431.405 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
0.20.431.405 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "Jordan came ashore Thursday evening. ", "add_special": true}
0.20.431.406 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[68043,3571,23083,451,7548,11129,13,220]}
0.20.431.779 D srv          stop: all tasks already finished, no need to cancel
0.20.431.787 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
0.20.431.788 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "CNN affiliate WAVY in Norfolk, Virginia, reported that he was able to walk from the helicopter into Sentara Norfolk General Hospital about 7:30 p.m. ", "add_special": true}
0.20.431.789 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[53593,20935,85288,56,303,56708,11,12617,11,4800,421,551,557,2858,310,4088,494,279,33866,1083,22636,4897,56708,3146,14639,883,220,22,25,18,15,280,721,13,220]}
0.20.432.240 D srv          stop: all tasks already finished, no need to cancel
0.20.432.251 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
0.20.432.252 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "Coast Guard officials have said they have found no reason to doubt Jordan's incredible story. ", "add_special": true}
0.20.432.253 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[7108,544,11912,7128,599,1018,781,599,1669,874,2781,310,10179,16586,579,14612,3255,13,220]}
