0.20.432.746 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
0.20.432.747 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "They noted that his father contacted them January 29 to report his son and his boat missing. ", "add_special": true}
0.20.432.747 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[6651,10036,421,780,6764,23767,1070,5869,220,17,24,310,1830,780,4292,321,780,14882,7167,13,220]}
