0.20.433.082 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
0.20.433.083 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "Frank Jordan addressed the skepticism about his son's appearance, saying the boat stayed afloat and upright most of the time. ", "add_special": true}
0.20.433.083 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[36091,16586,19457,279,63901,883,780,4292,579,10771,11,5315,279,14882,19013,264,3524,321,46966,1379,314,279,854,13,220]}
0.20.433.307 D srv          stop: all tasks already finished, no need to cancel
0.20.433.310 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
0.20.433.310 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "His son spent most of his days in the cabin, out of the sun. ", "add_special": true}
0.20.433.311 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[15514,4292,7157,1379,314,780,2756,303,279,12999,11,680,314,279,6797,13,220]}
