0.20.437.415 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "Jordan was dehydrated and said he was hungry. ", "add_special": true}
0.20.437.415 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[68043,557,401,24373,639,321,1018,551,557,28012,13,220]}
0.20.437.603 D srv          stop: all tasks already finished, no need to cancel
0.20.437.606 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
0.20.437.606 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "\"We took him to a rescue boat,\" the container ship captain said. ", "add_special": true}
0.20.437.606 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[10397,3738,1384,310,264,16679,14882,1288,279,5303,8026,23167,1018,13,220]}
0.20.437.950 D srv          stop: all tasks already finished, no need to cancel
0.20.437.953 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
0.20.437.953 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "\"He was given water and pea soup to gain some power again.\" Derriel Morris, a neighbor at the Bucksport Plantation Marina & RV Resort called Jordan a nice guy who loved his 47-year-old boat, named \"Angel.\" Morris said: \"It was immaculate, it was gorgeous, beautifully painted. ", "add_special": true}
