0.20.439.114 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[5836,551,27469,3672,852,1048,3756,1017,5467,264,36549,4009,20876,13,220]}
0.20.439.384 D srv          stop: all tasks already finished, no need to cancel
0.20.439.387 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
0.20.439.387 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "The marina's manager, Jeff Weeks, told WPDE that Jordan is expected to be back at Buscksport next week. ", "add_special": true}
