0.21.445.728 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
0.21.445.728 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "This new way of talking about climate change -- and linking it to public health issues -- was part of a roundtable discussion Tuesday at Howard University's College of Medicine. ", "add_special": true}
0.21.445.729 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[1919,491,1560,314,7169,883,9682,2222,1137,321,29697,424,310,569,2730,4562,1137,557,919,314,264,4625,1938,9915,7348,506,19265,3694,579,8853,314,18076,13,220]}
