0.21.446.854 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
0.21.446.854 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "\"I remember when I first went to college in Los Angeles in 1979, the air was so bad that you couldn't go running outside,\" Obama said. ", "add_special": true}
0.21.446.854 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[6825,5909,948,353,1118,3804,310,7524,303,9368,11563,303,220,16,24,22,24,11,279,3594,557,748,3743,421,488,7448,914,708,4162,4732,1288,6884,1018,13,220]}
