0.21.447.163 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
0.21.447.164 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "\"You'd have air quality alerts, and people who had respiratory problems or were vulnerable had to stay inside. ", "add_special": true}
0.21.447.165 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[20946,4035,599,3594,4131,28293,11,321,1208,852,995,40157,5154,466,998,18966,995,310,4565,4613,13,220]}
