0.21.447.662 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
0.21.447.664 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "\"Ultimately, though, all of our families are going to be vulnerable. ", "add_special": true}
0.21.447.664 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[1,64007,11,3384,11,660,314,1004,8259,513,2019,310,381,18966,13,220]}
