0.21.456.414 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "\"Framing global warming as a public health issue rather than as an environmental or national security one produces the most emotionally compelling response among people, since it focuses on the immediate implications a warmer climate would have on people's lives,\" the article says. ", "add_special": true}
