0.21.963.668 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
0.21.963.671 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "Former Australia cricket captain and legendary broadcaster Richie Benaud has died at the age of 84. ", "add_special": true}
0.21.963.672 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[29834,8071,34806,23167,321,26814,57861,95549,417,6933,643,682,8209,506,279,4092,314,220,23,19,13,220]}
