0.21.965.161 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
0.21.965.162 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "Benaud, whose witty one-liners from the commentary box resonated far beyond Australia's shores, said last year he was being treated for skin cancer. ", "add_special": true}
0.21.965.162 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[33,6933,643,11,6483,79784,799,2759,38384,494,279,29611,3618,27264,639,2944,7551,8071,579,60068,11,1018,1483,1007,551,557,1602,11421,364,6574,9108,13,220]}
0.21.966.023 D srv          stop: all tasks already finished, no need to cancel
0.21.966.028 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
0.21.966.028 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "\"After Don Bradman, there has been no Australian player more famous than Richie Benaud,\" Cricket Australia said on its website. ", "add_special": true}
0.21.966.028 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[95018,4179,16541,1461,11,1017,682,978,874,12982,2693,777,10919,1056,95549,417,6933,643,1288,55975,8071,1018,383,1141,3779,13,220]}
0.21.966.819 D srv          stop: all tasks already finished, no need to cancel
0.21.966.828 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
0.21.966.828 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "\"Benaud stood at the top of the game throughout his rich life, first as a record-breaking leg-spinner and captain, and then as cricket's most famous -- and most impersonated -- broadcaster.\" A veteran of 64 Test matches, Benaud was inducted into the Sport Australia Hall of Fame in 1985. ", "add_special": true}
0.21.966.829 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[61442,6933,643,14217,506,279,1844,314,279,1746,6600,780,8807,2199,11,1118,430,264,3150,52483,2392,67736,321,23167,11,321,1179,430,34806,579,1379,10919,1137,321,1379,57732,639,1137,57861,1149,357,20186,314,220,21,19,3284,8798,11,417,6933,643,557,303,52108,1083,279,17666,8071,10607,314,37247,303,220,16,24,23,20,13,220]}
0.21.967.719 D srv          stop: all tasks already finished, no need to cancel
0.21.967.734 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
0.21.967.735 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "While many regarded his voice as the soundtrack to an Australian summer, Benaud was equally revered by the cricketing public on the other side of the world where he spent more than four decades with the BBC taking the game into millions of British living rooms. ", "add_special": true}
0.21.967.735 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[7732,1599,25519,780,7497,430,279,43405,310,449,12982,7094,11,417,6933,643,557,17763,81739,539,279,34806,286,569,383,279,975,3008,314,279,1814,1332,551,7157,777,1056,2943,10476,440,279,17557,4483,279,1746,1083,11391,314,7607,5214,11683,13,220]}
0.21.968.552 D srv          stop: all tasks already finished, no need to cancel
0.21.968.560 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
0.21.968.562 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "But whether you were sitting in Sydney or in South London, there were plenty of \"marvelous\" Richie moments from the box to savor:. ", "add_special": true}
0.21.968.562 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[3850,3315,488,998,11362,303,20620,466,303,4725,6924,11,1017,998,10933,314,328,5437,861,757,1,95549,13543,494,279,3618,310,274,3185,16478,220]}
0.21.969.425 D srv          stop: all tasks already finished, no need to cancel
0.21.969.435 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
0.21.969.437 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "\"And Glenn McGrath dismissed for two, just ninety-eight runs short of his century.\" \"From our broadcasting box you can't see any grass at all. ", "add_special": true}
0.21.969.437 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[44385,37812,84724,572,25364,364,1330,11,1066,75211,67354,8213,2716,314,780,9018,1149,328,3702,1004,47194,3618,488,628,914,1436,866,15879,506,660,13,220]}
0.21.970.140 D srv          stop: all tasks already finished, no need to cancel
0.21.970.150 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
0.21.970.151 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "It is simply a carpet of humanity.\" \"Captaincy is 90% luck and 10% skill. ", "add_special": true}
0.21.970.152 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[2064,369,4777,264,26950,314,21265,1149,328,59001,10807,369,220,24,15,4,14583,321,220,16,15,4,9653,13,220]}
0.21.970.672 D srv          stop: all tasks already finished, no need to cancel
0.21.970.680 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
0.21.970.681 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "But don't try it without that 10%.\" News of his passing quickly generated a wave of condolences, including from Australian Prime Minister Tony Abbott. ", "add_special": true}
0.21.970.682 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[3850,1459,914,1380,424,1973,421,220,16,15,4,1149,5230,314,780,11946,5964,7658,264,11717,314,76477,11,2583,494,12982,12159,9206,17974,40733,13,220]}
0.21.971.197 D srv          stop: all tasks already finished, no need to cancel
0.21.971.202 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
0.21.971.203 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "\"To most Australians Richie Benaud was cricket. ", "add_special": true}
0.21.971.204 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[62921,1379,53964,95549,417,6933,643,557,34806,13,220]}
0.21.971.742 D srv          stop: all tasks already finished, no need to cancel
0.21.971.750 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
0.21.971.751 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "He personified its traditions and its values,\" Abbott said in a written statement Friday. ", "add_special": true}
0.21.971.752 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[1465,1637,1806,1141,29893,321,1141,2663,1288,40733,1018,303,264,5158,4952,6394,13,220]}
0.21.972.114 D srv          stop: all tasks already finished, no need to cancel
0.21.972.123 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
0.21.972.124 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "\"While many Australians only know Richard Benaud as the voice of cricket, we should not forget that in his day he was a cricketer with few equals. ", "add_special": true}
0.21.972.124 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[91587,1599,53964,1132,1366,11528,417,6933,643,430,279,7497,314,34806,11,567,1220,524,10351,421,303,780,1834,551,557,264,1505,839,1356,440,2342,16327,13,220]}
0.21.972.820 D srv          stop: all tasks already finished, no need to cancel
0.21.972.833 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
0.21.972.835 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "It was why he was so insightful as a commentator. ", "add_special": true}
0.21.972.836 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[2064,557,3069,551,557,748,66724,430,264,66414,13,220]}
0.21.973.205 D srv          stop: all tasks already finished, no need to cancel
0.21.973.213 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
0.21.973.214 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "\"As a player his record has withstood the test of time.  ", "add_special": true}
0.21.973.214 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[45567,264,2693,780,3150,682,440,49942,279,1228,314,854,13,256]}
0.21.973.649 D srv          stop: all tasks already finished, no need to cancel
0.21.973.667 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
0.21.973.669 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "He led the Australian side from 1958/59 through to 1963/1964, never losing a series in his 28 Tests as captain. ", "add_special": true}
0.21.973.670 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[1465,5879,279,12982,3008,494,220,16,24,20,23,14,20,24,1472,310,220,16,24,21,18,14,16,24,21,19,11,2496,12806,264,3878,303,780,220,17,23,19537,430,23167,13,220]}
0.21.974.123 D srv          stop: all tasks already finished, no need to cancel
0.21.974.140 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
0.21.974.143 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "\"As captain, he was first to lead a full Australian tour to India and Pakistan in 1959/60. ", "add_special": true}
0.21.974.144 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[45567,23167,11,551,557,1118,310,2895,264,2400,12982,6990,310,6535,321,16173,303,220,16,24,20,24,14,21,15,13,220]}
0.21.974.463 D srv          stop: all tasks already finished, no need to cancel
0.21.974.472 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
0.21.974.474 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "He was the first cricketer to reach a Test double of 2,000 runs and 200 wickets. ", "add_special": true}
0.21.974.475 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[1465,557,279,1118,1505,839,1356,310,5372,264,3284,1923,314,220,17,11,15,15,15,8213,321,220,17,15,15,288,16960,13,220]}
0.21.974.994 D srv          stop: all tasks already finished, no need to cancel
0.21.975.004 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
0.21.975.005 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "\"Given the special place Richie Benaud has in our national life, I have asked that on the day of his funeral flags fly at half-mast. ", "add_special": true}
0.21.975.005 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[1,21365,279,3175,1925,95549,417,6933,643,682,303,1004,5145,2199,11,353,599,4439,421,383,279,1834,314,780,29962,7789,11137,506,4139,1395,544,13,220]}
0.21.975.449 D srv          stop: all tasks already finished, no need to cancel
0.21.975.463 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
0.21.975.467 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "I extend my condolences and the condolences of the Australian people, to his wife Daphne and his family and friends. ", "add_special": true}
0.21.975.468 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[40,12663,821,76477,321,279,76477,314,279,12982,1208,11,310,780,7168,414,1294,785,321,780,2902,321,4627,13,220]}
0.21.976.199 D srv          stop: all tasks already finished, no need to cancel
0.21.976.207 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
0.21.976.211 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "Current Australian captain Michael Clarke posted an image of Benaud on Instagram with the message: \"What a man. ", "add_special": true}
0.21.976.212 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[5237,12982,23167,7687,41141,8194,449,2099,314,417,6933,643,383,13589,440,279,1876,25,328,3710,264,855,13,220]}
0.21.976.641 D srv          stop: all tasks already finished, no need to cancel
0.21.976.650 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
0.21.976.652 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "Extremely sad day. ", "add_special": true}
0.21.976.653 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[6544,51469,12065,1834,13,220]}
0.21.976.961 D srv          stop: all tasks already finished, no need to cancel
0.21.976.971 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
0.21.976.972 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "You were a lot more then just a cricketer Richie. ", "add_special": true}
0.21.976.972 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[2523,998,264,2609,777,1179,1066,264,1505,839,1356,95549,13,220]}
