mi Avocado and Cheese was delicious. Warning, the medium size sandwich is BIG.\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2021-11-28 21:43:45\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":2.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"I've been going to Sam's for the past several years while visiting beautiful Santa Barbara from the San Francisco Bay area. I've always enjoyed the sandwiches from Sam's. Unfortunately, my wife and I just finished eating their turkey sandwich and in all honesty, it' was just, Ok, more like disappointing...\\\\n\\\\nWe were disappointed because it appears the quality and taste of the sandwich has digressed to a \\\\\\\"point of no return\\\\\\\"... The sandwich was sloppily made, poorly wrapped, and importantly, the man behind the counter (usual guy) seems to have gotten cantankerous over time. He chastised me for not ordering both white and wheat bread sandwiches the way he wanted, getting perturbed for asking for olives in my sandwich and, he had a smart alec - bad attitude demeanor about him - poor customer service.\\\\n\\\\nSuffice it to say, we will not be going back to Sam's. There are too many good delis in the Cliffs Dr. area to be subjected to poor quality sandwiches and an unpleasant customer experience...\\\"}],\\\"state\\\":\\\"CA\\\"}\", \"original_answer\": \"\\\"Sam's To Go\\\" is a well-rated sandwich restaurant located at 315 Meigs Rd, Ste I, Santa Barbara, CA.\", \"source_sentence_offsets\": [{\"end_byte\": 862, \"source_sentence_id\": 0, \"start_byte\": 0, \"text_sha256\": \"sha256:c110b0c1fee4f40aad004d2a9077c350c9db9758562c31d6f6a6618d0df645df\"}, {\"end_byte\": 910, \"source_sentence_id\": 1, \"start_byte\": 862, \"text_sha256\": \"sha256:1315156f2103aa921ee3172f8d040a91b684c3ef413c7e24f0c00a7ff54858b2\"}, {\"end_byte\": 991, \"source_sentence_id\": 2, \"start_byte\": 910, \"text_sha256\": \"sha256:d71b201dba989c715923176c321b3fe650e352d812e670cf1a8451af69b8d7b4\"}, {\"end_byte\": 1070, \"source_sentence_id\": 3, \"start_byte\": 991, \"text_sha256\": \"sha256:8873422