n the visible source that supports it. A citation proposes evidence and does not prove entailment. Preserve the answer as written. Use null when no visible sentence is a proposed witness.<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"complete_source\": \"{\\\"address\\\":\\\"5575 Hollister Ave\\\",\\\"attributes\\\":{\\\"Ambience\\\":{\\\"casual\\\":false,\\\"classy\\\":false,\\\"divey\\\":false,\\\"hipster\\\":false,\\\"intimate\\\":false,\\\"romantic\\\":false,\\\"touristy\\\":false,\\\"trendy\\\":false,\\\"upscale\\\":false},\\\"BusinessParking\\\":{\\\"garage\\\":false,\\\"lot\\\":true,\\\"street\\\":false,\\\"valet\\\":false,\\\"validated\\\":false},\\\"Music\\\":null,\\\"OutdoorSeating\\\":true,\\\"RestaurantsGoodForGroups\\\":false,\\\"RestaurantsReservations\\\":false,\\\"RestaurantsTakeOut\\\":true,\\\"WiFi\\\":\\\"free\\\"},\\\"business_stars\\\":4.0,\\\"categories\\\":\\\"Mediterranean, Restaurants, Greek\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Goleta\\\",\\\"hours\\\":null,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Mediterra Market and Cafe\\\",\\\"review_info\\\":[{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2013-08-19 18:52:35\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":4.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"I love this place.  Customer Service is excellent, everything out of the kitchen looks and tastes homemade.  Very cool, european atmosphere indoors.  Outdoors is really just the parking lot but the owners are very accommodating.\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2013-07-19 19:19:22\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":3.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"i got the combo plate and it was not a very good value. the food is decent, but they are very stingy with their meat on this plate. its ok if youre really craving mediterranean, but otherwise i wouldnt go there due to the meat portions.\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2013-07-11 00:02:00\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":5.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"I feel really lucky to have found this place. Its in a location that is easily overlooked. I've been searching for good Mediterranean food and I finally found it. The man that works here is so friendly and awesome. The gyro and falafel are great. And I'm pretty sure the pita bread is homemade. Its delicious! I will be back again and again.\\\"}],\\\"state\\\":\\\"CA\\\"}\", \"original_answer\": \"Mediterra Market and Cafe is a Mediterranean restaurant located at 5575 Hollister Ave in Goleta, CA.\", \"source_sentence_offsets\": [{\"end_byte\": 675, \"source_sentence_id\": 0, \"start_byte\": 0, \"text_sha256\": \"sha256:a69c4cd177b057526d1946b4d3df41cae75765cdc845910e0c3148e87ccc1ea9\"}, {\"end_byte\": 764, \"source_sentence_id\": 1, \"start_byte\": 675, \"text_sha256\": \"sha256:c321114a1f4051fcd82e0cde454d0ff5fa58d7ae70095c9cc3b8c7c39bb5b9fd\"}, {\"end_byte\": 805, \"source_sentence_id\": 2, \"start_byte\": 764, \"text_sha256\": \"sha256:0f303cbba4ba026eedcf88982eb7a81dfb1023882d1c947dd3480cf18023655c\"}, {\"end_byte\": 1013, \"source_sentence_id\": 3, \"start_byte\": 805, \"text_sha256\": \"sha256:25b9a70c60c6b796c88132fc6a2d7819c2d1d305aa1d7cf6771c105972f50b33\"}, {\"end_byte\": 1089, \"source_sentence_id\": 4, \"start_byte\": 1013, \"text_sha256\": \"sha256:aa0b4c303960081177b8f39d4e2dd3cdbba0ec451b7a5806b62094ccf6744dc4\"}, {\"end_byte\": 1313, \"source_sentence_id\": 5, \"start_byte\": 1089, \"text_sha256\": \"sha256:69e3f1117f226c4db7da6afb4f095c4e9fa0d14e81ded81d7393a534ec53c141\"}, {\"end_byte\": 1358, \"source_sentence_id\": 6, \"start_byte\": 1313, \"text_sha256\": \"sha256:8f60c3e44bae49469c68d762e74576df9905b03089ecab8f85d7070039f5e538\"}, {\"end_byte\": 1430, \"source_sentence_id\": 7, \"start_byte\": 1358, \"text_sha256\": \"sha256:f3a8ea8599fbc1e85d19b9159ee244cabeac901ff82240c18dd8d30d829c4cd6\"}, {\"end_byte\": 1482, \"source_sentence_id\": 8, \"start_byte\": 1430, \"text_sha256\": \"sha256:adfc2a4ec390b264d65095d46559a5faa89aea16ec85ab67a1e4e03f3f79fb3b\"}, {\"end_byte\": 1514, \"source_sentence_id\": 9, \"start_byte\": 1482, \"text_sha256\": \"sha256:f3455e4b4a507afd0150bb821c161c7e14636a5c7b5c6fa430a6461d110016c9\"}, {\"end_byte\": 1562,