e visible source that supports it. A citation proposes evidence and does not prove entailment. Preserve the answer as written. Use null when no visible sentence is a proposed witness.<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"complete_source\": \"{\\\"address\\\":\\\"966 Embarcadero Del Mar, Unit C\\\",\\\"attributes\\\":{\\\"Ambience\\\":null,\\\"BusinessParking\\\":null,\\\"Music\\\":null,\\\"OutdoorSeating\\\":null,\\\"RestaurantsGoodForGroups\\\":null,\\\"RestaurantsReservations\\\":null,\\\"RestaurantsTakeOut\\\":null,\\\"WiFi\\\":null},\\\"business_stars\\\":4.5,\\\"categories\\\":\\\"Restaurants, Chinese, Hot Pot, Pan Asian, Szechuan, Chicken Wings\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Isla Vista\\\",\\\"hours\\\":{\\\"Friday\\\":\\\"11:0-14:0\\\",\\\"Monday\\\":\\\"11:0-14:0\\\",\\\"Saturday\\\":\\\"11:0-14:0\\\",\\\"Sunday\\\":\\\"11:0-14:0\\\",\\\"Thursday\\\":\\\"11:0-14:0\\\",\\\"Tuesday\\\":\\\"11:0-14:0\\\",\\\"Wednesday\\\":\\\"11:0-14:0\\\"},\\\"name\\\":\\\"Jay C's Place\\\",\\\"review_info\\\":[{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2020-07-24 00:35:40\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":5.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"This place always being one of my favourite! Friendly owner and Foods are sooooooooooo good! I love their homemade dumplings, Chicken popcorn, Taiwanese sausage, pork belly bowl, special carts noodle and lamp skewers!!\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2020-03-23 00:54:06\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":5.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"Place has amazing homemade dumplings that I can't get enough of. The staff is very nice and helpful. I went for the soft opening and while it wasn't perfect, they did all they could to make the service amazing, and it worked. They also serve Mala Tang, which I tried, and it was really good. The medium spicy is exactly as it sounds like. They also have other items I haven't tried yet but I will definitely go back for more!\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2020-02-25 08:58:42\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":2.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"A bit pricey for just a simple dumplings n malatang ( the spicy soup) ... But it taste good... Just not worthy to go back again.\\\"}],\\\"state\\\":\\\"CA\\\"}\", \"original_answer\": \"Jay C's Place is a popular Chinese restaurant located in Isla Vista, CA, known for its delicious homemade dumplings, Chicken popcorn, Taiwanese sausage, pork belly bowl, special carts noodle, and lamp skewers.\", \"source_sentence_offsets\": [{\"end_byte\": 676, \"source_sentence_id\": 0, \"start_byte\": 0, \"text_sha256\": \"sha256:a12df41131e47c02ea13dcc7921de656a2ce984e1466f1f4aee546ae75270b3a\"}, {\"end_byte\": 724, \"source_sentence_id\": 1, \"start_byte\": 676, \"text_sha256\": \"sha256:9a36c7dee464f16a66e3ea716649ff761830060b1dbc93bdd868d8e6301401ea\"}, {\"end_byte\": 988, \"source_sentence_id\": 2, \"start_byte\": 724, \"text_sha256\": \"sha256:a620259c88c73fee416d6a3efcd1534587907d3488e64a106ed47ec9be144029\"}, {\"end_byte\": 1024, \"source_sentence_id\": 3, \"start_byte\": 988, \"text_sha256\": \"sha256:25b48afbdaf036fb274a0d4e8aa9539839a2c5f8d53514ed90dc4a594b9b373c\"}, {\"end_byte\": 1149, \"source_sentence_id\": 4, \"start_byte\": 1024, \"text_sha256\": \"sha256:3e360a23c18e9c4e7aa8e52b5f6ba44cc2f2903f3dee85677d19e39c6cae2358\"}, {\"end_byte\": 1215, \"source_sentence_id\": 5, \"start_byte\": 1149, \"text_sha256\": \"sha256:e51751611dc05183bcc7f1e12d51cda4264078d2bc2c72482902b20f8b71f7c9\"}, {\"end_byte\": 1262, \"source_sentence_id\": 6, \"start_byte\": 1215, \"text_sha256\": \"sha256:4da94ab1a442d8302667abfa468c3ac2d3ac58f04b46381ef33f9b7af84d5295\"}, {\"end_byte\": 1496, \"source_sentence_id\": 7, \"start_byte\": 1262, \"text_sha256\": \"sha256:b893feed6b6ee1303097e3c5fa2ba835443d1d45611d4d4773372e4674c89cc9\"}, {\"end_byte\": 1517, \"source_sentence_id\": 8, \"start_byte\": 1496, \"text_sha256\": \"sha256:fd5b3df3e7f282c0d7c7ca9ed8cc7cd4e597897626d3bfa7e7ab7c05fcb20505\"}, {\"end_byte\": 1567, \"source_sentence_id\": 9, \"start_byte\": 1517, \"text_sha256\": \"sha256:1ba1f259694aadf095d60e511a6d4c31caa5445bf963302a